+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166724614,"discussion_id":"e0c2d50f80338b2253a26f6abf98cdec66bdba5b","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化PadV3Grad算子的边缘模式（edge mode）梯度计算内核。主要解决了原代码逻辑分支较多、不够简洁的问题，通过重构计算逻辑，提升了代码的可读性和潜在的运行性能。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n核心修改是重构了`CalScope`函数，将原先独立的裁剪判断逻辑（`IsCut`）集成到该函数内部，通过`flag`变量在计算每个维度的填充范围时同步处理裁剪情况。此举消除了原先在多个`SimtComputeEdgeDim*`函数中存在的`if-else`分支，统一了所有线程路径为累加计算。此外，统一了`scopeIndex`数组和循环变量的类型为模板参数`U`，并添加了必要的`static_cast`转换，使类型使用更清晰一致。","created_at":"2026-03-28T15:19:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-28T15:19:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166729550,"discussion_id":"e97af3d4185dbec5b660e027acefc1e77e3b375c","body":"/check-pr","created_at":"2026-03-28T15:44:35+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-28T15:44:35+08:00","user":{"id":"671f75e4d1bf1f7663bead4d","login":"chenyuqiao","object_id":"671f75e4d1bf1f7663bead4d","name":"chenyuqiao","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/da/de/d4972a99552d8304e6a76beb6534c9eb74e68b2e5f3e172ec12746d44b334c4e.png","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenyuqiao"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":166729576,"discussion_id":"1206c68d3c5d49ec4f6ee5e3b6ae30e9873fc196","body":"**The following labels are not ready**.\n\nlgtm: Please wait for reviewers to review the code.\n\napproved: Please wait for committers to review the code.\n\nci-pipeline-passed: Please wait for the CI test to be completed.\n\n","created_at":"2026-03-2